(6798604, 1021870, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to make of this one.  The leaves in the foreground are framing the coaster, but the white of the structure makes me look there first, and it looks slightly askew.  If I had just gotten off the ride I would probably be seeing things rather more obviously skewed, and I find myself wanting to see the people on the ride more than anything else in the scene.</td>', 'Not sure what to make of this one.  The leaves in the foreground are framing the coaster, but the white of the structure makes me look there first, and it looks slightly askew.  If I had just gotten off the ride I would probably be seeing things rather more obviously skewed, and I find myself wanting to see the people on the ride more than anything else in the scene.', '2012-06-20 08:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6798605, 1021339, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and I love the colors and subtle patterns in the bokeh.  Puts a bit of warmth in the scene.</td>', 'Great perspective and I love the colors and subtle patterns in the bokeh.  Puts a bit of warmth in the scene.', '2012-06-20 08:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
