(6798672, 1021961, 143098, '<td valign="top">Nice one...you know these 2 cylinder tractors were nick named johnny poppers. Got a dead one out a the farm sittin in the weeds also. shooting old tractors never gets old.</td>', 'Nice one...you know these 2 cylinder tractors were nick named johnny poppers. Got a dead one out a the farm sittin in the weeds also. shooting old tractors never gets old.', '2012-06-20 09:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
