(6798810, 1022006, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, but I''m not seeing any foreground bokeh. The overall fog or gaussian blur doesn''t qualify in my understanding of bokeh.  The background bokeh is very nice, and I like the mood of the image.</td>', 'This is lovely, but I''m not seeing any foreground bokeh. The overall fog or gaussian blur doesn''t qualify in my understanding of bokeh.  The background bokeh is very nice, and I like the mood of the image.', '2012-06-20 13:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
