(6799566, 1021450, 149507, '<td valign="top">The grass feels like it''s just in the way. A much tighter framing would make for a better photo overall but then you wouldn''t have any foreground bokeh.</td>', 'The grass feels like it''s just in the way. A much tighter framing would make for a better photo overall but then you wouldn''t have any foreground bokeh.', '2012-06-21 23:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
