(6800923, 1021533, 15711, '<td valign="top">It feels very secretive and clandestine.  I''m not a huge fan of foreground bokeh, but this... I like. :)</td>', 'It feels very secretive and clandestine.  I''m not a huge fan of foreground bokeh, but this... I like. :)', '2012-06-24 01:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
