(6800925, 1021556, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the sense of fluidity.  Really gorgeous.</td>', 'I love the sense of fluidity.  Really gorgeous.', '2012-06-24 01:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6800926, 1021465, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is awesome.  Perfect in black and white. Your title rocks. 8</td>', 'This is awesome.  Perfect in black and white. Your title rocks. 8', '2012-06-24 01:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6800927, 1021807, 15711, '<td valign="top">My first thought: Prince Harry. LOL</td>', 'My first thought: Prince Harry. LOL', '2012-06-24 01:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6800928, 1021375, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous cat.  My son is really on my case to get another one, after we lost ours of 15 years last month.  I''d take this one in a heartbeat!  7</td>', 'What a gorgeous cat.  My son is really on my case to get another one, after we lost ours of 15 years last month.  I''d take this one in a heartbeat!  7', '2012-06-24 01:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6800930, 1022009, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is perfection to me.  Like a moonlit mushroom hut of the gnomes.  FAB!!! 10</td>', 'This is perfection to me.  Like a moonlit mushroom hut of the gnomes.  FAB!!! 10', '2012-06-24 01:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6800931, 1021884, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is so lovely and gentle feeling.  I can hear the grass under her feet.  We have deer like this all around and I love to watch them as they flick their tails and graze.</td>', 'This is so lovely and gentle feeling.  I can hear the grass under her feet.  We have deer like this all around and I love to watch them as they flick their tails and graze.', '2012-06-24 01:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6800932, 1021997, 15711, '<td valign="top">I never see them with their wings at rest.  What a lovely peaceful moment for him (and you). 7</td>', 'I never see them with their wings at rest.  What a lovely peaceful moment for him (and you). 7', '2012-06-24 01:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6800936, 1021838, 142345, '<td valign="top">I like the different perspective here.</td>', 'I like the different perspective here.', '2012-06-24 02:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6800965, 1021807, 96664, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=34876" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Eagle40Fox2</a> without a beard?<br/> <br/>Hmm... <br/> <br/>Either way I like it. :)</td>', ' Eagle40Fox2 without a beard? Hmm...  Either way I like it. :)', '2012-06-24 07:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6800994, 1021339, 3936, '<td valign="top">Excellently done!  The foreground and background bokeh draw the eye to the subject immediately.  If you are not LydiaToo, should take as a compliment, that this immediately made me think of her style and capabilities.</td>', 'Excellently done!  The foreground and background bokeh draw the eye to the subject immediately.  If you are not LydiaToo, should take as a compliment, that this immediately made me think of her style and capabilities.', '2012-06-24 11:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801021, 1021733, 3936, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  This image can be interpreted on so many levels.  Brings to mind the monolith of 2001 a Space Oddesy.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  This image can be interpreted on so many levels.  Brings to mind the monolith of 2001 a Space Oddesy.  Nicely done.', '2012-06-24 11:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801023, 1021931, 3936, '<td valign="top">Is that Spiderman in the foreground?  ;-)<br/> <br/>Love the detail, and textures of this image. Almost a 3D effect.  I feel like I could almost reach, or walk, into this image.</td>', 'Is that Spiderman in the foreground?  ;-) Love the detail, and textures of this image. Almost a 3D effect.  I feel like I could almost reach, or walk, into this image.', '2012-06-24 11:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801024, 1021045, 3936, '<td valign="top">I think this one is a contender for a ribbon.  Nice dreamy feel to it.</td>', 'I think this one is a contender for a ribbon.  Nice dreamy feel to it.', '2012-06-24 12:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801102, 1021977, 143116, '<td valign="top">Very nice, would be perfect if the bokeh color would''ve better matched the rose</td>', 'Very nice, would be perfect if the bokeh color would''ve better matched the rose', '2012-06-24 14:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801104, 1021789, 143116, '<td valign="top">I like it, one of the bst!</td>', 'I like it, one of the bst!', '2012-06-24 14:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801106, 1021339, 143116, '<td valign="top">Great shot</td>', 'Great shot', '2012-06-24 14:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801108, 1021893, 143116, '<td valign="top">Now I see the Eiffel tower. With just a little less bokeh this would score better, I think.</td>', 'Now I see the Eiffel tower. With just a little less bokeh this would score better, I think.', '2012-06-24 14:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801118, 1021299, 143116, '<td valign="top">I see foreground and background bokeh, but where''s the subject?</td>', 'I see foreground and background bokeh, but where''s the subject?', '2012-06-24 14:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801119, 1021938, 143116, '<td valign="top">Hide &amp; seek</td>', 'Hide & seek', '2012-06-24 14:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801151, 1022009, 66384, '<td valign="top">Rather hard to see the bokeh, because it is so dark. But the image is really nice. Points for the good image, but a little off for the obscure bokeh.</td>', 'Rather hard to see the bokeh, because it is so dark. But the image is really nice. Points for the good image, but a little off for the obscure bokeh.', '2012-06-24 15:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801157, 1021948, 66384, '<td valign="top">Looks lik the blur was add in post processing, and not very well at that. The blur has cut a chair in half in a very odd way, and the blur isn''t adjusted for distance.</td>', 'Looks lik the blur was add in post processing, and not very well at that. The blur has cut a chair in half in a very odd way, and the blur isn''t adjusted for distance.', '2012-06-24 15:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801158, 1021998, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very unusual. I like the colors and the impressionistic feel of this.</td>', 'Very unusual. I like the colors and the impressionistic feel of this.', '2012-06-24 15:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801160, 1021786, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very nice! The bokeh is definitely a main feature of this image and enhances it well.</td>', 'Very nice! The bokeh is definitely a main feature of this image and enhances it well.', '2012-06-24 15:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801161, 1021019, 66384, '<td valign="top">Rather difficult to distinguish the bokeh through all the noise and other blur. But I do like the image.</td>', 'Rather difficult to distinguish the bokeh through all the noise and other blur. But I do like the image.', '2012-06-24 15:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801162, 1021931, 66384, '<td valign="top">Definite blur in the foreground, but for me it doesn''t enhance the image. Instead it stands in my way, blocking my view.</td>', 'Definite blur in the foreground, but for me it doesn''t enhance the image. Instead it stands in my way, blocking my view.', '2012-06-24 15:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801170, 1021339, 66384, '<td valign="top">Ha, nice! The bokeh leads me right to the subject, and the circles of confusion create a happy feel.</td>', 'Ha, nice! The bokeh leads me right to the subject, and the circles of confusion create a happy feel.', '2012-06-24 15:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801172, 1021239, 66384, '<td valign="top">Odd having the foreground at the top of the picture. But it works.</td>', 'Odd having the foreground at the top of the picture. But it works.', '2012-06-24 15:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801173, 1021447, 66384, '<td valign="top">The border is distracting. A simple black line would have been better, IMO, but I''m not deducting for that. I am partial to lizards, and I like the tones in this image.</td>', 'The border is distracting. A simple black line would have been better, IMO, but I''m not deducting for that. I am partial to lizards, and I like the tones in this image.', '2012-06-24 15:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801174, 1021853, 66384, '<td valign="top">Oh, cool. At first I thought this was a laundromat, but your titled helped me sort it out.</td>', 'Oh, cool. At first I thought this was a laundromat, but your titled helped me sort it out.', '2012-06-24 16:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801175, 1021697, 66384, '<td valign="top">She''s adorable, and what could be nicer than a pretty child in a field of daisies!</td>', 'She''s adorable, and what could be nicer than a pretty child in a field of daisies!', '2012-06-24 16:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801177, 1021299, 66384, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what it is but I like the image.Nice contrast, colors, composition, and DOF.</td>', 'Don''t know what it is but I like the image.Nice contrast, colors, composition, and DOF.', '2012-06-24 16:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801179, 1021982, 66384, '<td valign="top">Outstanding! You nailed it, and with such feeling.</td>', 'Outstanding! You nailed it, and with such feeling.', '2012-06-24 16:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801244, 1021928, 91496, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition.  I love the foregraound area.  i have mixed feelings about the single colored/shiney object in a field of brown/textured.</td>', 'Very interesting composition.  I love the foregraound area.  i have mixed feelings about the single colored/shiney object in a field of brown/textured.', '2012-06-24 19:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801246, 1021336, 91496, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  I would have liked this better in a Free Study or Abstract  challenge.  As far a foreground boekeh challenge you need a subject to be in the foreground of, otherwise it is just plain bokeh.</td>', 'Interesting photo.  I would have liked this better in a Free Study or Abstract  challenge.  As far a foreground boekeh challenge you need a subject to be in the foreground of, otherwise it is just plain bokeh.', '2012-06-24 19:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801250, 1021777, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the portait very much as it has very nice lighting.  Not sure the lights add much.  Also nothing denotes the llghts are in the foreground -- it could be just as easily background.</td>', 'I like the portait very much as it has very nice lighting.  Not sure the lights add much.  Also nothing denotes the llghts are in the foreground -- it could be just as easily background.', '2012-06-24 19:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801251, 1022007, 91496, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  The lighting and framing here are beautiful.  The bokeh pleasantly frames the photo.</td>', 'Lovely.  The lighting and framing here are beautiful.  The bokeh pleasantly frames the photo.', '2012-06-24 19:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801252, 1021902, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the plaecment of the subjects and the reflection of the bottle.  The foreground bokek is kind of subtle and perhaps less DOF would have made it more interesting.</td>', 'I like the plaecment of the subjects and the reflection of the bottle.  The foreground bokek is kind of subtle and perhaps less DOF would have made it more interesting.', '2012-06-24 19:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801255, 1021697, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait with good tones and lighting.  Not sure the foreground bokeh adds much.  The BG bokeh is great.</td>', 'Nice portrait with good tones and lighting.  Not sure the foreground bokeh adds much.  The BG bokeh is great.', '2012-06-24 19:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801257, 1021917, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like all the greens and yellows.  Foreground bokeh is pretty minimal and the shot overall does not real have a subject or point of interest.  Not a fan of the border.</td>', 'I like all the greens and yellows.  Foreground bokeh is pretty minimal and the shot overall does not real have a subject or point of interest.  Not a fan of the border.', '2012-06-24 19:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801258, 1021904, 91496, '<td valign="top">The title makes this photo.  Nice angles and story.</td>', 'The title makes this photo.  Nice angles and story.', '2012-06-24 19:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801260, 1021296, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like how the yellow contrasts with the black  I think the foreground bokeh detracts from the photo rather than enhasces it.</td>', 'I like how the yellow contrasts with the black  I think the foreground bokeh detracts from the photo rather than enhasces it.', '2012-06-24 19:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801261, 1021935, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like how the foreground bokeh leads you to the subject and the sharpest part of the photo.  White hotspots are a minor weak point.</td>', 'I like how the foreground bokeh leads you to the subject and the sharpest part of the photo.  White hotspots are a minor weak point.', '2012-06-24 19:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801263, 1021977, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the intent here.  I am not sure the "dirty" foreground bokeh is all the appealing here.</td>', 'I like the intent here.  I am not sure the "dirty" foreground bokeh is all the appealing here.', '2012-06-24 19:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801266, 1021733, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the foreground balls (although some of them a too blown out).  Perhaps a rectangular crop of the top half woul have more impact.</td>', 'I like the foreground balls (although some of them a too blown out).  Perhaps a rectangular crop of the top half woul have more impact.', '2012-06-24 19:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801267, 1022006, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice mood here with all the muted tones.  I see lots of background bokeh, which is beautiful, but only a small ammount of foreground bokeh which is not that far from being in focus.</td>', 'Nice mood here with all the muted tones.  I see lots of background bokeh, which is beautiful, but only a small ammount of foreground bokeh which is not that far from being in focus.', '2012-06-24 19:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801268, 1021786, 91496, '<td valign="top">I wish I had this imaage in my portfolio.  Great composition.  Nice control of the DOF.  May be worth trying to clone of the empty chair if you ever print it or submit to other competitions.</td>', 'I wish I had this imaage in my portfolio.  Great composition.  Nice control of the DOF.  May be worth trying to clone of the empty chair if you ever print it or submit to other competitions.', '2012-06-24 20:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801272, 1021833, 91496, '<td valign="top">Intersting composition.  The desaturation works well here.  I wonder if a differnet angle would have shown off the hole better, as I find it kind of incidental to the image right now.</td>', 'Intersting composition.  The desaturation works well here.  I wonder if a differnet angle would have shown off the hole better, as I find it kind of incidental to the image right now.', '2012-06-24 20:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801274, 1021088, 40391, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done! Should ribbon.</td>', 'Beautifully done! Should ribbon.', '2012-06-24 20:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801276, 1021777, 40391, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting.</td>', 'Lovely lighting.', '2012-06-24 20:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6801277, 1021045, 40391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.</td>', 'Beautiful image.', '2012-06-24 20:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
